line-height:12.2pt"><b><span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt">The Heart and Stroke Foundation of Canada,<i>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Interveners on the</i></span></b></p>
