line-height:12.2pt"><i><span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt">Code of Civil Procedure of Québec</span></i><span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt">, art. 523.</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;
line-height:12.2pt"><span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left:.5in;text-align:justify;text-justify:
inter-ideograph;text-indent:-.5in;line-height:12.2pt"><i><span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt"><a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/30---31-vict-c-3-en#!fragment/sec91" target="_blank">Constitution Act, 1867<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a></span></i><span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt"><a class="reflex2-link" href="https://qweri.lexum.com/w/calegis/30---31-vict-c-3-en#!fragment/sec91" target="_blank">, s.&nbsp;91<span class="decisia-reflex2-icon">&nbsp;<span class="icon-external-link"></span></span></a></span><span style="letter-spacing:-.1pt">.</span></p>
